        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By offering highly professional, personalized banking products and service delivery methods and employing advanced banking technologies, we seek to distinguish ourselves from larger, regional banks operating in our market area and are able to compete effectively with other community banks.",
        "start_character": 896,
        "end_character": 1186
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-008073",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-008073-30a65d4f928799ff",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-008073",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Due to the consolidation of financial institutions in our primary market area, we believe there is a significant opportunity for a local bank to provide a full range of financial services.",
        "start_character": 707,
        "end_character": 895
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-008073",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-008073-30a65d4f928799ff",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-008073",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we were the first bank headquartered in the Commonwealth of Virginia to offer the Certificate of Deposit Account Registry Service (\"CDARS\"), an innovative deposit insurance solution from the IntraFi Network, LLC (\"IntraFi\") that provides Federal Deposit Insurance Corporation (“FDIC”) insurance on deposits up to $50 million.",
        "start_character": 5374,
        "end_character": 5712
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-008073",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-008073-30a65d4f928799ff",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-008073",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe a significant customer base in our market prefers to do business with a local institution that has a local management team, a local Board of Directors and local founders and that this customer base may not be satisfied with the responsiveness of larger regional banks.",
        "start_character": 3811,
        "end_character": 4090
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-008073",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-008073-30a65d4f928799ff",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-008073",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer a full range of banking services to individuals, small to medium-sized businesses and professional service organizations through both traditional and electronic delivery.",
        "start_character": 4892,
        "end_character": 5071
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-008073",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-008073-30a65d4f928799ff",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-008073",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide our clients with local decision making and individualized service coupled with products and services offered by our larger institutional competitors.",
        "start_character": 16652,
        "end_character": 16812
      },
      {
